/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0009333496.wav|diana|en|It doesn't make any sense that it would disappear like that.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0009818010.wav|diana|en|We left eight all by herself.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0020606401.wav|diana|en|A quick scan shows all my systems are operating normally.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0031983636.wav|diana|en|Uh, Hugh? Is your headset broken?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0036579581.wav|diana|en|Let's play hide-and-seek again. You won't find me this time.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0037332296.wav|diana|en|It's pretty fun talking like this.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0039705223.wav|diana|en|But what if there's something worse than getting hurt?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0048428988.wav|diana|en|It's a really cool machine that lets you do training simulations!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0051000474.wav|diana|en|Toys? I've never had toys before.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0051621225.wav|diana|en|Look, I got good, right?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0053708759.wav|diana|en|I think so. I didn't see any other bots or humans.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0055168359.wav|diana|en|The mannequins we saw had a lot of different kinds of outfits.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0058155574.wav|diana|en|Or maybe I just wasn't good enough.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0066980577.wav|diana|en|You're pretty different from all the other grown-ups I've met.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0072339889.wav|diana|en|I may not remember anything before the vault, but this has to be the most fun I've ever had.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0077155459.wav|diana|en|If you want a bigger Pragmata, it would be more efficient to start from scratch.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0092150023.wav|diana|en|I'm okay. All the bots on the cradle have been made to withstand the moon's environment.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0092631354.wav|diana|en|And, like, I've always had this function that lets me manipulate data transmissions.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0098460259.wav|diana|en|Oh, Hugh? Remember when I said you're useful?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0098477992.wav|diana|en|Do you think eight's okay? Must be hard controlling that much dead filament.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0100539940.wav|diana|en|Hugh, have you ever lived in New York?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0106660120.wav|diana|en|I'll be able to help you even more than before!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0107952976.wav|diana|en|Aww, I was sure you wouldn't find me there.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0109990024.wav|diana|en|Because of you, I've had so much fun and learned new things.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0110735882.wav|diana|en|Maybe Edus is using it to make more bots.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0113598157.wav|diana|en|Maybe it's the same for replicators.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0118600073.wav|diana|en|Ten, nine, eight, seven, six.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0120044213.wav|diana|en|No, it's me wearing pretty clothes. I want to wear something like this one day.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0124542596.wav|diana|en|Hm? Didn't you say before that you don't like kids?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0137699821.wav|diana|en|And I wanted to give this to you so you'd remember.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0138409145.wav|diana|en|Alright. You gotta be careful too, okay?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0140453686.wav|diana|en|Hugh, can I go outside to play some time?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0143210117.wav|diana|en|Air Raiders really zoom around fast, huh?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0156627506.wav|diana|en|Let's finish our game of hide and seek from earlier. You better find me this time.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0157532068.wav|diana|en|Yay, it's so cute!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0160253719.wav|diana|en|It gets kind of bumpy riding on your back, though. It's hard to hold on sometimes.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0161823896.wav|diana|en|Well, let's try our best, Q.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0165044535.wav|diana|en|You can learn more about the Cradle's bots with this.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0169101871.wav|diana|en|Everything we need is already at the cradle. So why do we need Earth stuff?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0170732915.wav|diana|en|Kids sound kind of weird.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0173811499.wav|diana|en|Getting nutrients from talking? That's so weird.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0178053861.wav|diana|en|Hugh, is something wrong?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0194578384.wav|diana|en|Why was every mannequin wearing something different?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0206814035.wav|diana|en|Hey, Hugh, how are humans and bots different?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0210176717.wav|diana|en|Um, I'm not sure. I don't remember.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0214734259.wav|diana|en|Mm-hmm. But we'll need to find the right mats.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0218909709.wav|diana|en|You won't find me next time. I'll pick a super hard spot.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0222653025.wav|diana|en|No! You're doing great! And you're really, really useful!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0226097762.wav|diana|en|I think the Luna Diggers made that too.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0230380776.wav|diana|en|That lunadigger came out of nowhere!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0240692514.wav|diana|en|Hmm. Q? Does this bring back memories?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0241083811.wav|diana|en|Mmm, that might have been something Edith made on its own.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0241493505.wav|diana|en|Hey, then let's play later, okay?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0243259230.wav|diana|en|Well, what do you think would look good?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0249469186.wav|diana|en|I don't feel it like humans do, but my system will assign it a numerical value.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0255412879.wav|diana|en|Oh yeah, I have a question about that globe.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0262363658.wav|diana|en|The eight I knew wouldn't do that.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0263600664.wav|diana|en|Earth has tons of stuff like this, right?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0268163955.wav|diana|en|Lonely? I don't know about that, but it was pretty boring.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0269506593.wav|diana|en|Let's find something that suits you better.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0274864461.wav|diana|en|I kinda want you to find me, but I kinda don't.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0275185778.wav|diana|en|Plus, if I flew away, we wouldn't be able to talk. That'd be bad.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0276443592.wav|diana|en|Oh, oh, I just thought of the perfect hiding place. You're never going to find me.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0278456783.wav|diana|en|New York was so big. I liked all the sparkly things.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0290032677.wav|diana|en|Do you think she's okay? She sounded in trouble.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0292783870.wav|diana|en|I'm not some AI bot. I'm a state-of-the-art pragma-
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0299391589.wav|diana|en|Five, four, three, two, one.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0300191237.wav|diana|en|Why did you thank Edith for the warm welcome?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0300844253.wav|diana|en|I was designed to experience human feelings and sensations like you do.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0302425205.wav|diana|en|There's all these lines all over it. Isn't that annoying for the people who live there?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0328986832.wav|diana|en|Hugh, if you were doing something dangerous, would you want someone to stop you?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0329448753.wav|diana|en|I can't wait to see a real ocean. Let's go to Earth soon, okay?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0330625487.wav|diana|en|Thanks for always keeping me company and talking to me.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0334284616.wav|diana|en|Terminal Hunting Pro?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0334553730.wav|diana|en|The Pterodome is amazing!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0336026240.wav|diana|en|But you're always like, what the hell is this? So I thought you'd be interested.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0336669060.wav|diana|en|This outfit is kind of me right now.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0340227390.wav|diana|en|That replicator was broken. We gotta fix it.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0345372228.wav|diana|en|Um, hey, so, uh...
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0346050612.wav|diana|en|They have a name, you know. It's Cabin!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0347910405.wav|diana|en|I drew lots, but this one turned out the best.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0353987897.wav|diana|en|Then one day, I just tried it out. Pretty cool, huh?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0362387399.wav|diana|en|Thanks, Hugh. I'll do my best.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0362686859.wav|diana|en|Hmm. I wonder if R.E.M.'s will make me feel better, too.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0365704723.wav|diana|en|No, it's not. Cats walking on the moon would be cute.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0366552059.wav|diana|en|Hmm. There's something odd on this terminal.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0368094487.wav|diana|en|Also, my body was made with special components, so fixing me isn't easy.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0371265693.wav|diana|en|The more living stuff dead filament eats, the bigger it gets.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0373251010.wav|diana|en|I know I wasn't of much use, but I really wanted to help her.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0376645120.wav|diana|en|And Earth's covered in living things.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0380117668.wav|diana|en|Phew! Let's play hide-and-seek. Ready or not, here we go!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0386081165.wav|diana|en|Hugh, what kind of clothes do you like? Is your suit your favorite?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0387118101.wav|diana|en|Pterodome trees are so cool! They can grow really fast!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0388085821.wav|diana|en|Even if Nicholas is gone, I'll still be here for you. I'll try my best to surpass his efficiency.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0393082055.wav|diana|en|Yeah, it's the best. We've seen all kinds of nature.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0393264855.wav|diana|en|but they probably don't want to walk around here.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0394921180.wav|diana|en|Lunadiggers are really scary. They get all tense when they pop out.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0397186865.wav|diana|en|Come on, let's do something.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0400158518.wav|diana|en|Did you see? The branches just grew in from nowhere!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0403137242.wav|diana|en|Fine. Don't worry about me.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0407282938.wav|diana|en|What goodies did we bring back this time?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0414909150.wav|diana|en|If so, let's pretend we're cats. I'll be a cute striped one and...
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0415056878.wav|diana|en|No, Edus only manages the bots.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0417190162.wav|diana|en|Hide and seek time. Good luck, Hugh.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0421604478.wav|diana|en|I can't believe Daisy died.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0427020398.wav|diana|en|But still, I don't feel like 8 does. Is that because I'm not as good as she is?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0439235269.wav|diana|en|When dead filament gets on bots, they start acting all weird, right?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0440255598.wav|diana|en|Yeah, okay. Let's go.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0440342556.wav|diana|en|I don't know why, but wearing new clothes is super fun.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0441843202.wav|diana|en|I'm glad all the trees didn't go away.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0442553986.wav|diana|en|Yeah, I thought that was the case.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0443784048.wav|diana|en|Wait, just a few seconds.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0453005673.wav|diana|en|That big lunadigger came right for the platform we were on.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0459660410.wav|diana|en|Really? That's boring.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0466615926.wav|diana|en|I don't know, but I can try learning.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0468317238.wav|diana|en|That bot was gigantic! I didn't know they made them that big!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0471055782.wav|diana|en|I won't queue. Thanks.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0473892725.wav|diana|en|On humans, it'd wipe out the whole infected area, not just the dead filament.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0483412760.wav|diana|en|Even big bots don't stand a chance when we work together.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0485376212.wav|diana|en|Phew! I have a surprise for you.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0487256210.wav|diana|en|Hey, now that the power's back on, we can take the tram somewhere new.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0487479684.wav|diana|en|I don't know, but I think Edith made that one.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0493473138.wav|diana|en|You! Tell me a story!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0507479877.wav|diana|en|Maybe we'll learn more if we read all of it.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0508002162.wav|diana|en|Hey, isn't this a Reed Earth memory?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0513675734.wav|diana|en|What happens if the nutrients aren't enough?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0517804774.wav|diana|en|I want to try on lots of outfits too!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0526932679.wav|diana|en|Did you know animal bots can function on the moon just like me?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0532098880.wav|diana|en|I won't. Let's go stop eight.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0536097896.wav|diana|en|And there was no one else to talk to either.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0536834666.wav|diana|en|Hugh, are you okay?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0537430282.wav|diana|en|I know! I'm so happy!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0538957238.wav|diana|en|It won't, because I don't have to carry anything.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0542574636.wav|diana|en|The pterodome would be so empty without them.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0551351600.wav|diana|en|Space storms mess with signals all the time, so your guess was pretty good.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0567547904.wav|diana|en|But for bots, the dead filament just kind of sticks to them.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0568150657.wav|diana|en|Well, I've got you to talk to, so I'll probably be fine.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0568425068.wav|diana|en|I feel like we went everywhere.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0578352389.wav|diana|en|The replicator bridges are so cool!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0578570735.wav|diana|en|Those bots just kept on coming. I thought they'd never end.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0581802666.wav|diana|en|I'll just be over here. Hmm. By myself.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0583294749.wav|diana|en|Okay. Thanks, Hugh.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0589016266.wav|diana|en|I can't believe Ape made Edus attack all the people at the cradle.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0589803231.wav|diana|en|And now I'll never see him again.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0590106975.wav|diana|en|Yeah, he was always talking about Daisy.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0591737504.wav|diana|en|So, I'm giving it to you.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0604825907.wav|diana|en|That was fun. Let's play again sometime.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0606930368.wav|diana|en|Didn't expect such a big bot to get in our way.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0609368626.wav|diana|en|That tree was so big. Guess that's why the lift wouldn't work.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0612063500.wav|diana|en|Yeah, it feels off somehow.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0615207456.wav|diana|en|Fine.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0616374521.wav|diana|en|I don't know. Maybe they just didn't need me anymore.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0620241559.wav|diana|en|Neat! All I really need to function is a power source.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0622380874.wav|diana|en|Hmm, I can't really find the words, but...
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0624231024.wav|diana|en|Look at all the suits here. They look just like yours.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0632664829.wav|diana|en|Eight and I were made to help her get better.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0648752624.wav|diana|en|Ew, come on. Try harder next time.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0650015134.wav|diana|en|Hugh, thanks for everything.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0651575400.wav|diana|en|Do you think she'll get better if we get rid of it all?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0657120845.wav|diana|en|Yeah, I guess that makes sense.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0659205470.wav|diana|en|What was that black stuff?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0660654025.wav|diana|en|Hmm, especially if you forget something.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0664602399.wav|diana|en|Can I come too? I've never met a scruffy little mutt before.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0677287247.wav|diana|en|You're more than that. Um...
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0683136659.wav|diana|en|Now that the power's back on, we can probably go see more areas.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0692621654.wav|diana|en|Hugh, you're a really good person.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0694821702.wav|diana|en|You! Over here!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0700150845.wav|diana|en|Smart? What's that supposed to mean? I don't have any special add-ons installed.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0700381205.wav|diana|en|So, what's an amusement park?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0702728420.wav|diana|en|That bot was big, but still really fast.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0710666550.wav|diana|en|and DI-03367, a state-of-the-art pragmatic created here at The Cradle.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0718277996.wav|diana|en|Did you see that bot's face? It opened.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0718909857.wav|diana|en|It's so fun talking to you, Hugh.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0723193944.wav|diana|en|Just like he never saw her again.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0723324958.wav|diana|en|That big bot was in our way, so I don't think so.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0727010126.wav|diana|en|What? Really?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0730252658.wav|diana|en|This time, I'm going to be the one doing the saving.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0731850454.wav|diana|en|Hey, when people go away, it's sad, right?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0739896048.wav|diana|en|Hey, can I give you something?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0747467010.wav|diana|en|Hee hee hee hee hee hee Ha ha Hee hee hee hee
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0749201808.wav|diana|en|Phew, that was a lot of container moving.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0763394651.wav|diana|en|It's bots always have messed up designs and serial numbers.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0782413112.wav|diana|en|Um, well, I'm a state-of-the-art pragmata that Edus can't control.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0788265801.wav|diana|en|Whoa! It's a SimPod! Let's try it out!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0789412261.wav|diana|en|I'll hide first. Come and find me.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0793270512.wav|diana|en|I couldn't believe my eyes. The sparkling water. The gentle breeze.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0794063691.wav|diana|en|I'm a hide-and-seek master!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0794600952.wav|diana|en|Okay. I can't wait!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0804166716.wav|diana|en|Really? Everything?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0804278813.wav|diana|en|So, are you still sad that Nicholas is gone?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0808745570.wav|diana|en|They spent all day mining Lunum.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0811363664.wav|diana|en|All clear. No bots in sight.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0816617045.wav|diana|en|Huh? Are we done playing?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0817578015.wav|diana|en|I know, but there should be.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0819720590.wav|diana|en|Hugh, I've got a surprise. You're gonna love it.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0821448515.wav|diana|en|I'm not really sure, but it says the owner of the data is unknown.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0829802115.wav|diana|en|Whoa, this is so cool!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0837826126.wav|diana|en|We're both pragmata, so there's got to be a way to get along, right?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0848375497.wav|diana|en|Really? But you know so much about it, though.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0855441651.wav|diana|en|But those bots are pretty much everywhere, so...
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0857442539.wav|diana|en|Hugh, you said later, right? Is now a good time?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0858266568.wav|diana|en|I think it's the dead filament's fault.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0863752917.wav|diana|en|I love it when we can bring stuff back with us.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0865288266.wav|diana|en|They're really nice. They call me Little One.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0866881578.wav|diana|en|Yay! We got all the beacons now!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0879710203.wav|diana|en|Phew! We rebooted both the Regulators!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0882432993.wav|diana|en|It was easy. I was in sleep mode.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0887914392.wav|diana|en|You're not feeling sick from the gravity shifts?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0891919927.wav|diana|en|Hey, look! This terminal has bot data saved in it.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0894092220.wav|diana|en|And if a body gets hurt too bad, it'll die, right?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0894790307.wav|diana|en|Even if I tried really hard, it won't work.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0904548809.wav|diana|en|I want to stop her, but I can't believe she's acting this way.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0910131561.wav|diana|en|Back here again. Safe and snug.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0914903437.wav|diana|en|I don't know. How about you?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0918743614.wav|diana|en|And the test worked, but that just got her killed.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0919286301.wav|diana|en|Thank you. Thanks for talking to me all the time.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0928503030.wav|diana|en|Maybe someone who didn't work at the Cradle saved it here.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0929906583.wav|diana|en|We're not making good progress, but we got to stop eight.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0930105866.wav|diana|en|Maybe if I did have a friend, I wouldn't have ended up in the vault.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0937294299.wav|diana|en|I don't get tired. Are you getting sleepy?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0938778559.wav|diana|en|Let's talk a bunch while we have the chance.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0942890338.wav|diana|en|Let's get lots of REMs and decorate the shelter.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0942922497.wav|diana|en|You said that I need to be more careful, and that I should try not to get hurt.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0944513685.wav|diana|en|Ugh, what's taking so long?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0953757862.wav|diana|en|REMs are pretty weird, don't you think?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0971189411.wav|diana|en|So if we're together, you will keep me safe?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0974042538.wav|diana|en|Q, do you have any children?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0978468949.wav|diana|en|If we reboot one more limb regulator, the tree will disappear!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0982854827.wav|diana|en|We'll stop Edus and rescue it no matter what.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0982952072.wav|diana|en|That big round bot from before was pretty tough.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0984375867.wav|diana|en|The sea was so pretty.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0986022368.wav|diana|en|I get we were made differently. Our bodies, our materials, our functions.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0990275475.wav|diana|en|Not many, because I'm specially made.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0990801169.wav|diana|en|Hmm. Yeah.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0992269535.wav|diana|en|I can learn things, but I won't get taller.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/0999410759.wav|diana|en|That's why I'm glad I found you so quickly.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1001611847.wav|diana|en|It's going to go great next time.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1003788059.wav|diana|en|Maybe she got this way because of all the built-up sadness in the dead filament.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1004634916.wav|diana|en|Did you see, Hugh? There are birds!
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1012764272.wav|diana|en|Huh? Like, a prediction? I make those all the time.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1022966554.wav|diana|en|Oh, Luna Dickers have been helping out at the cradle for ages.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1032619737.wav|diana|en|I see. In that case, I'll keep playing in the shelter then.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1036259640.wav|diana|en|Hugh, I was really sad when I found out what happened to the doctor.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1041756808.wav|diana|en|Wouldn't it be fun if there were replicator bridges everywhere?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1048798849.wav|diana|en|But, Q, can we try climbing the tree before it's gone?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1054373245.wav|diana|en|Look what I have.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1059249691.wav|diana|en|Now with Eda's acting all weird, they probably got moved inside.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1059638825.wav|diana|en|We can stay here for a while, right?
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1061989499.wav|diana|en|Hmm. I think they're supposed to work outside.
/workspace/VoiceReplication/reference_voice/ch05000_base_dialogue__en/1072892802.wav|diana|en|Wow, Hugh, you're so good at this.
